{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Guten Abend. Ich heiße Hinako Kitano. Vielen dank, dass ihr immer mich unterstützt."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで！46回目のファンの方が\n考えてくださった今日の冒頭あいさつは\nたくちゃんさんからいただきました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ドイツ語みたいだよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/01/3853811/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/01/3853811/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/01/3853811/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きょうも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きいちゃんにきいちゃおう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/01/3853811/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆ごとぅーさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁マーカーペンとかを使ってて、よそ見しながらキャップをしめようとするとキャップにはまらずに気付いたら手がインクまみれになってる！\n何あるあるですか？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎ずばり！！！\n96あるあるです！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆賢者の贈り物さん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁のぎえいごで世界進出って言ってたけど、いままでいった事ある国は？思い出は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎ニューヨークだけです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆黒石 しょうちゃんさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁5月29日の握手会では、何着るか決まってるの？o(^▽^)o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎まだ、決めていません！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん何か来て欲しいものややってほしいことありますかー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆ひろっぴさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁きいちゃんは何の為に貯金してるの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎確か、のぎえいごの収録時は\nうなぎの丼ぶりをいっぱい食べたい！って\n答えたかな？、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆よねさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁メンバーにつけたあだ名で最近ハマってるのは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎ざきち。(やまざきれなさん)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆マダガスカルの雪男さん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁「きいちゃんは普通の柿と干し柿だったら、どっちが好き？\n俺は、普通のが好き！\n干し柿も甘みが増して美味しいんだけどね(^-^)」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎普通の柿！！！\n干し柿を食べたことがない！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"柿食べたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/01/3853811/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のきいちゃんにきいちゃおう！は\nここまで！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また次もします♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/01/3853811/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヒナコセレクト(仮)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/01/3853811/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(1)  ゆうたろうさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎きいちゃんはもしお金がいくら使ってもなくならないくらいあったらどんなことに使いたい？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎そんなこと考えたことなかったから迷うな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うーん、どうしよう！\nでも、自分のためじゃなくて\n家族や動物や誰かのために\n使うかな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんならどうしますかー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■更新日の(21)  バギーさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎今年は1番なんの仕事したい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎見たことのない自分や景色をみてみたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何でもやってみたいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだなにもやったことがないくらいなので！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(175)  ゆうすけさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎きいちゃんの苦手な食べ物はなんですか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎ゲテモノ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(200)  てるるさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎ズバリ、目玉焼きには何派？？？\n僕は断然ケチャップ派ですね♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎醤油派です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、ブラックペッパーや塩胡椒でもいけます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(450)  ドイツからの乃木坂ファンさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎皆の撮影でしたか？もしかして乃木中の撮影\n日奈のブログも書いたけど、お祝いした？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎皆んなでの撮影でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"になの、お誕生日はお祝いしたよ～！\n可愛いケーキでした(｡・・｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"になおめでとう♡だいすき♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(717) noy46未央奈推し ぱるる酔いさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎突然ですが、ぱるるが可愛い過ぎますどーしたら良いですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎好きという気持ちは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうにもならないと思います。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(750)  ノビカースケさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎きいちゃんの小さい頃の夢は何でしたか？僕はブラジルでサッカー選手になることでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎いろいろなものを言っていましたが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お花屋さん♪とかケーキ屋さん♪\nみたいな女の子の代表的な夢ではなかったです！\nでも、いまはお花屋さんもケーキ屋さんも\n体験してみたいな～って思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(1000)  てっちゃん@viviろうさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎もうどうなったて良い 格好悪くたって良い\n死にものぐるいで未来を変えてやる\nどうしたって 変えれない運命だと言われても\nまだ俺は変われる 自分で変えてみせる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎素敵な歌詞ですね。ありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/01/3853811/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のヒナセレはこれにて終了ー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また、次やります♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/01/3853811/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの方が考えてくださった\nブログ締めのあいさつ\n39回目は待ち受けチップさんからです！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"There is always light behind the clouds."}],"source":"archive"}